cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use linnet, cite the version-specific Zenodo DOI for the version you
  used.
title: linnet
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Huber
    given-names: Lucien
    affiliation: University of Bern
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-5074-7313"
abstract: >-
  The complete linnet software family comprises linnet, clinnet, linnet-py, and
  linnest. It provides half-edge graph data structures and algorithms for
  subgraphs, tensor networks, and Feynman diagrams.
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.15494393"
    description: Concept DOI for all linnet versions
keywords:
  - graph algorithms
  - half-edge data structures
  - Feynman diagrams
  - tensor networks
  - Rust
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/alphal00p/gammaloop"
